   "part": null,
   "latex": "$a = 2,\\ r = 3$. $T_4 = ar^3 = 54$, $T_5 = ar^4 = 162 < 300$, $T_6 = 2 \\times 3^5 = 486 > 300$. So 5 terms. Answer B.",
   "marks_breakdown": null,
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
   "question": "2",
   "part": null,
   "latex": "$S_{15} = \\dfrac{a(r^{15}-1)}{r-1} = \\dfrac{2(3^{15}-1)}{3-1} = 3^{15} - 1 = 14348906$. Answer B.",
   "marks_breakdown": null,
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
   "question": "3",
   "part": null,
   "latex": "$k + 2k + k + 3k + k + 2k = 1$, so $10k = 1$ and $k = \\dfrac{1}{10}$. Answer B.",
