  },
  {
   "question": "5",
   "part": null,
   "latex": "$\\log 3 + \\log 3^2 + \\log 3^4 + \\ldots = \\log 3 + 2\\log 3 + 4\\log 3 + \\ldots$\n\n$a = \\log 3,\\ r = 2$, $S_n = \\dfrac{a(r^n - 1)}{r - 1}$\n\n$S_6 = \\dfrac{\\log 3\\,(2^6 - 1)}{2 - 1} = 63\\log 3\\ (= \\log 3^{63})$",
   "marks_breakdown": null,
   "source": "extracted"
  },
  {
